OL,3,GNEWSACycling in east 'restrictive' for
OL,4,Acommuting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lack of cycling infrastructure in
OL,7,Fpart of the island is discouraging
OL,8,Fcommuters on bikes and people riding
OL,9,Ffor pleasure locally.
OL,11,FAnais Pansart from Gorey said though
OL,12,Fshe enjoyed cycling, it was
OL,13,F"restrictive" and "complicated" in the
OL,14,Feast because of a lack of cycle paths
OL,15,Fso she had stopped commuting to work by
OL,16,Fbike.
OL,18,FPeople cycling to work from the west of
OL,19,FJersey benefit from cycle routes along
OL,20,Fthe railway walk, St Peter's Valley,
OL,21,Fand from St Aubin into St Helier.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
